                <pb facs="0414" n="408" sameAs="frus:frus1894app2/pg408"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Foster to Mr.
                            Stevens.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-02-22"><hi rendition="#italic">February 22,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The treaty of annexation is still pending in the Senate. Confirming previous
                    instructions, you are directed, in cooperation with the naval authorities, to
                    support the Provisional Government in the maintenance of security to life and
                    property and good order, until action shall be had upon the treaty.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Foster</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
